  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0: NivaraEmbeddingGenerator<TInput> wraps any IEmbeddingGenerator<TInput, Embedding<float>> as a label column generator for NivaraFrame.FromRows; brings Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions into Extensions; ArrowConversionOptions.UseZeroCopy removed (placeholder paths were silently copying; real zero-copy returns with ARROW-ROADMAP Phase D). Parquet read/write with compression, Apache Arrow bidirectional conversion, ML.NET DataView integration, CsvHelper-based CSV parsing, lazy data source infrastructure.",
